# `coverage` artifact, locally they're throwaway.
.coverage
coverage.json
htmlcov/
# Runtime profile individuation from `agentctl spawn` / `co` dispatch into this repo
.claude/
# Live launchd plist carries provider secrets (Phase C); only the .example is tracked
launchd/com.convivy.llm-gateway.plist
# Scratch PR description, root only. Anchored deliberately: unanchored, this would
# also ignore docs/pr-body.md or any nested one, and lib/agent-platform/worktrees.py
# treats a nested pr-body.md as real content rather than debris (_is_debris matches
# the exact root path, and its tests assert docs/pr-body.md is NOT debris). An
# unanchored line would drop such a file from `git add` with no error.
/pr-body.md
